<meta name="description" content="UFO Catcher 9 Second - Crane Machine is an arcade prize redemption game created by Sega Corporation. It is the newest iteration of Sega's popular UFO Catcher crane games, Improvements include no front pillar and a transparent plexiglass backing panel, allowing prizes to be viewed from all angles and providing operators flexibility in placing the machine. In addition, the playfield is broken up into sections, each of which have individually-adjustable heights.
" />
